<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
<meta charset="UTF-8">
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">

<title>Eagle Sports | Sports Fields & Landscaping</title>

<style>
*{
    margin:0;
    padding:0;
    box-sizing:border-box;
    scroll-behavior:smooth;
}

body{
    font-family:Arial, sans-serif;
    background:#07100c;
    color:#fff;
    line-height:1.6;
}

header{
    min-height:100vh;
    display:flex;
    align-items:center;
    justify-content:center;
    text-align:center;
    padding:30px;
    background:
    linear-gradient(rgba(0,0,0,.62),rgba(0,0,0,.78)),
    url("https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1553778263-73a83bab9b0c?auto=format&fit=crop&w=2000&q=85")
    center/cover;
}

.hero{
    max-width:900px;
}

.eagle{
    font-size:80px;
    margin-bottom:10px;
}

.logo-name{
    font-size:58px;
    font-weight:bold;
    letter-spacing:5px;
}

.green{
    color:#35d078;
}

.tagline{
    font-size:21px;
    color:#ddd;
    margin:20px 0 30px;
}

.btn{
    display:inline-block;
    padding:14px 28px;
    margin:6px;
    border-radius:30px;
    text-decoration:none;
    font-weight:bold;
    background:#35d078;
    color:#061009;
    transition:.3s;
}

.btn:hover{
    transform:translateY(-3px);
    background:#fff;
}

.btn-dark{
    background:transparent;
    color:white;
    border:1px solid #35d078;
}

section{
    padding:80px 8%;
}

.title{
    text-align:center;
    margin-bottom:45px;
}

.title h2{
    font-size:40px;
    margin-bottom:10px;
}

.title p{
    color:#aaa;
}

.services{
    display:grid;
    grid-template-columns:repeat(auto-fit,minmax(240px,1fr));
    gap:25px;
}

.card{
    background:#0d1b15;
    border:1px solid #1c3929;
    border-radius:18px;
    overflow:hidden;
    transition:.3s;
}

.card:hover{
    transform:translateY(-8px);
    border-color:#35d078;
}

.card img{
    width:100%;
    height:210px;
    object-fit:cover;
}

.card-content{
    padding:25px;
}

.card h3{
    color:#35d078;
    font-size:23px;
    margin-bottom:10px;
}

.card p{
    color:#bbb;
}

.about{
    background:#0b1711;
}

.about-content{
    max-width:900px;
    margin:auto;
    text-align:center;
}

.about-content p{
    color:#ccc;
    font-size:18px;
}

.projects{
    display:grid;
    grid-template-columns:repeat(auto-fit,minmax(280px,1fr));
    gap:20px;
}

.project{
    position:relative;
    height:280px;
    overflow:hidden;
    border-radius:18px;
}

.project img{
    width:100%;
    height:100%;
    object-fit:cover;
    transition:.5s;
}

.project:hover img{
    transform:scale(1.08);
}

.project span{
    position:absolute;
    bottom:0;
    left:0;
    right:0;
    padding:25px;
    background:linear-gradient(transparent,rgba(0,0,0,.9));
    font-size:20px;
    font-weight:bold;
}

.contact{
    text-align:center;
    background:#07100c;
}

.contact-box{
    max-width:650px;
    margin:auto;
    background:#0d1b15;
    padding:40px;
    border-radius:20px;
    border:1px solid #1c3929;
}

.contact-box p{
    margin:12px 0;
    font-size:18px;
}

.whatsapp{
    background:#25D366;
}

footer{
    text-align:center;
    padding:25px;
    background:#030705;
    color:#888;
}

@media(max-width:600px){
    .logo-name{
        font-size:38px;
    }

    .tagline{
        font-size:17px;
    }

    .title h2{
        font-size:32px;
    }

    section{
        padding:60px 6%;
    }
}
</style>
</head>

<body>

<header id="home">
    <div class="hero">

        <div class="eagle">🦅</div>

        <div class="logo-name">
            EAGLE <span class="green">SPORTS</span>
        </div>

        <p class="tagline">
            Sports Fields Construction • Maintenance • Landscaping
        </p>

        <a href="#services" class="btn">OUR SERVICES</a>
        <a href="https://wa.me/201063093177" class="btn whatsapp">
            WHATSAPP
        </a>

    </div>
</header>


<section id="services">

    <div class="title">
        <h2>Our <span class="green">Services</span></h2>
        <p>Professional solutions for sports and outdoor spaces.</p>
    </div>

    <div class="services">

        <div class="card">
            <img src="https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1556056504-5c7696c4c28d?auto=format&fit=crop&w=1000&q=85">
            <div class="card-content">
                <h3>⚽ Sports Fields</h3>
                <p>
                    Professional construction and development of football
                    and multi-sport fields.
                </p>
            </div>
        </div>

        <div class="card">
            <img src="https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1626224583764-f87db24ac4ea?auto=format&fit=crop&w=1000&q=85">
            <div class="card-content">
                <h3>🎾 Padel Courts</h3>
                <p>
                    Complete padel court solutions including construction,
                    installation and development.
                </p>
            </div>
        </div>

        <div class="card">
            <img src="https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1518609878373-06d740f60d8b?auto=format&fit=crop&w=1000&q=85">
            <div class="card-content">
                <h3>🔧 Maintenance</h3>
                <p>
                    Professional maintenance and renovation to keep your
                    sports facilities performing at their best.
                </p>
            </div>
        </div>

        <div class="card">
            <img src="https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1558904541-efa843a96f01?auto=format&fit=crop&w=1000&q=85">
            <div class="card-content">
                <h3>🌿 Landscaping</h3>
                <p>
                    Modern landscape design and outdoor development for
                    residential, commercial and sports spaces.
                </p>
            </div>
        </div>

    </div>
</section>


<section class="about">

    <div class="title">
        <h2>Why <span class="green">Eagle Sports?</span></h2>
    </div>

    <div class="about-content">

        <p>
            Eagle Sports provides professional solutions for sports fields
            and outdoor spaces, combining quality materials, skilled
            workmanship and practical project planning.
        </p>

        <br>

        <p>
            From construction and installation to maintenance and
            landscaping, we aim to create spaces that look exceptional,
            perform efficiently and last.
        </p>

    </div>

</section>


<section>

    <div class="title">
        <h2>Our <span class="green">Vision</span></h2>
        <p>Creating modern spaces where performance meets design.</p>
    </div>

    <div class="projects">

        <div class="project">
            <img src="https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1431324155629-1a6deb1dec8d?auto=format&fit=crop&w=1200&q=85">
            <span>Professional Sports Facilities</span>
        </div>

        <div class="project">
            <img src="https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1600679472829-3044539ce8ed?auto=format&fit=crop&w=1200&q=85">
            <span>Modern Outdoor Spaces</span>
        </div>

        <div class="project">
            <img src="https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1558521958-0a228e77e984?auto=format&fit=crop&w=1200&q=85">
            <span>Landscape & Green Areas</span>
        </div>

    </div>

</section>


<section id="contact" class="contact">

    <div class="title">
        <h2>Let's Build Something <span class="green">Great</span></h2>
        <p>Contact Eagle Sports for your next project.</p>
    </div>

    <div class="contact-box">

        <p>📞 <strong>01063093177</strong></p>

        <br>

        <a class="btn" href="tel:01063093177">
            CALL US
        </a>

        <a class="btn whatsapp"
           href="https://wa.me/201063093177">
            WHATSAPP
        </a>

    </div>

</section>


<footer>
    © 2026 Eagle Sports. All Rights Reserved.
</footer>

</body>
</html>
